From: Aether Linux <aether@localhost>
Subject: [PATCH] hgfsServer: preserve const on the hidden-file basename

The filename is read-only and the substring is only inspected. This also
works with newer headers that preserve const through string searches.

--- a/lib/hgfsServer/hgfsServerLinux.c
+++ b/lib/hgfsServer/hgfsServerLinux.c
@@ -1364,7 +1364,7 @@
 HgfsGetHiddenAttr(char const *fileName,         // IN:  Input filename
                   HgfsFileAttrInfo *attr)       // OUT: Struct to copy into
 {
-   char *baseName;
+   const char *baseName;
 
    ASSERT(fileName);
    ASSERT(attr);
